  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="bb797fca-ea63-51d3-80b8-fe9ded6492d9" activityNameId="a2d62d3c-30d3-50ea-b698-71963acefdca" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic panel, perovskite-Si-tandem, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic panel, perovskite-Si-tandem, at plant
LCI of CHEOPS perovskite silicon tandem modules to be produced by OXPV in Germany. LCI published in de Wild-Scholten, M. 2017: Deliverable 3.1 Life Cycle Analysis of CHEOPS technologies and benchmarking: Screening. Published LCI embeddeed in UVEK LCI data DQRv2:2018. Changes to LCI: Transport calculated based on given distances in Tabel 2 of Wild-Scholten (2017). Panel area is 1.6m2.;
UUID: f78826c6-5fbb-3c7f-bb49-d75071eb827c
Included are the manufacture of single-silicon PV cells in China, supply of raw materials for perovskite semiconductor, glass, aluminium frame, working and packaging materials as well as waste disposal, transport and emissions of lead to air and water.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Company data
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Company data 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f78826c6-5fbb-3c7f-bb49-d75071eb827c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
